## Phase 3 — classification history *(completed)*

Migration: `supabase/migrations/20260826110000_athlete_classification_history.sql`

Schema-only from the client’s perspective — `upsert_athlete_profile` and
`hud_telemetry` keep the same signatures.

- Table `athlete_classification_history` (`kind` ∈ `perceived`/`verified`,
  `previous_value`, `new_value`, `occurred_at`)
- Locked down: `REVOKE ALL … FROM PUBLIC, anon, authenticated`; only the two
  `SECURITY DEFINER` functions write
- **Perceived:** `upsert_athlete_profile` inserts when declared rank changes
  (including first declaration); same-rank save → no row
- **Verified:** `hud_telemetry` inserts when computed rank differs from last
  history row — only advances when the user opens `/hud` (only place verified
  rank is computed); never stored except in this history table

### Ops note (this branch vs `main`)

Apply **`20260826110000_athlete_classification_history.sql`** on each environment
that does not already have it. Phase 0’s `analytics_events` migration is already
on `main` — only this Phase 3 file is new relative to `main`.

### Known unrelated migration replay issue

