## Phase 4 — reporting layer *(completed)*

Migration: `supabase/migrations/20260826130000_reporting_views.sql`

Read-only SQL views for internal reporting (Supabase SQL editor or BI with
service role). No client grants (`REVOKE ALL … FROM PUBLIC, anon, authenticated`).

| View | What it answers |
|------|-----------------|
| `v_rpc_reliability` | Call volume, error rate, p50/p95 latency per RPC |
| `v_realtime_reliability` | Channel status counts + subscribe latency |
| `v_audio_unlock_rate` | AudioContext state mix |
| `v_claim_funnel` | Prompt → claim / conflict rates |
| `v_rally_conversion` | Link copies vs deep-link joins |
| `v_intake_funnel` | Submit vs abandon |
| `v_template_performance` | Sessions created/completed by template |
| `v_session_abandonment` | Finished vs abandon-beacon rate |
| `v_host_vs_joiner_retention` | First-role cohorts: avg sessions / active days |

### Ops note (this branch vs `main`)

Phases 0–3 migrations are already on `main`. Apply
**`20260826130000_reporting_views.sql`** on each environment that does not
already have it.

